      <h1 class="jr-h1">How to Increase Bone Density: What Actually Moves the Number</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">Most advice on bone density is a calcium list with no doses and no mention of the one intervention that reliably raises a DEXA score. This is the version with numbers attached — including the trials where supplements did nothing at all.</p>

